Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你的性感二厨  希拉蕊吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Is this Hillary, your hot assistant chef, Hillary?
