Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今年的春装一定很棒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, wow, the spring line's really gonna be great this year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.49,0:06:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说罗夫罗兰在复印室   跟某人亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I hear, uh, Ralph Lauren fooled around with someone in the copy room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从头说起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guysHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的牙齿怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened to your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.69,0:07:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我漂白了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I whitened them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我不该直视它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I shouldn't look directly at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来啊  我是说真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实也白得太夸张了  你的人类\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're really, really, really white. What was wrong with your old...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的牙齿呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...human teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的确把漂白胶上得太久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did leave the gel on a little longer than it said to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太久有多久啊   一整天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much longer? A day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  罗斯  今晚要跟希拉蕊约会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross you know that tonight is your date with Hillary?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道  所以我才漂白牙齿  真的  有那么糟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. That's why I did it. Come on, are they really that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心好了  希拉蕊是瞎子吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'll be fine. Hillary's blind, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过了今晚就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She will be after tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你有没有发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Rach. Uh, do you notice anything--?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的牙齿  我在外面就看到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your teeth? Yes, I saw them from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说了你们绝对不信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys are never gonna believe this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比跟罗夫罗兰亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but Phoebe made out with Ralph Lauren.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.33,0:08:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她去我的办公室  然后他们就亲热了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She ran into him at my office, and they just made out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最扯的是  我因此赢得老板欢心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The craziest thing is, now my boss likes me because...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说这是一整年最棒的八卦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I told her about it and she said it was the best gossip she’d heard all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天   我真以我的朋友们为荣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am proud of all my friends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  不敢相信   菲比居然跟罗夫罗兰亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, I can't believe Phoebe made out with Ralph Lauren.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是忌妒死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh. I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是钱德  你活生生的男朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I'm Chandler, your live-in boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, please. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是女人  不过他还真是秀色可餐啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I am no woman, but that is one tasty dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:08:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个银发老帅哥是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's the silver fox'?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的亲热对象  你不认得吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is your make-out buddy. Don't you recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  "菲比  我爱你  吻我"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait. "Ooh, Phoebe, I love you. Kiss me, please."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是罗夫罗兰   不过声音有点像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not Ralph Lauren. It sounds like him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  罗夫跟他一点也不像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, no, Ralph doesn't look like that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很年轻  长发落腮胡  背个大包包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's young, and he's got long hair and a beard and a Hacky Sack--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪   那不是罗夫罗兰   那是复印小弟肯尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. That's not Ralph Lauren. That's Kenny the copy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完了   我还跑去告诉我老板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God-I told my boss that someone made out with Ralph Lauren.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是她发现我骗她   一定会更讨厌我   菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If she finds out that I lied to her, she is gonna hate me even more. Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个小弟为什么自称罗夫罗兰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would the copy guy say he's Ralph Lauren?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好骗你跟他亲热啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To get you to make out with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许这件能压住你的白牙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, maybe this will make them look less white.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.01,0:10:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nope.Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  没有用的颜色有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so colors that don't work are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝  黄  绿  红  黑  白  橘和紫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...blue, yellow, green, red, black, white, orange and purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离约会只剩1小时  我该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what I'm gonna do. That date starts in like an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你的肤色白一点  牙齿就不会那么显眼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, maybe if your skin was lighter, your teeth wouldn't look so bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  所以我去换肤就行了  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great. So all I need to do is get some new skin. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你可以化一点妆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I’m just saying, If we put just a little bit of makeup on you--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经不是13岁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not 13 anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  只剩这个可行的办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, this is the only thing left that has a shot at working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不会发现我有化妆吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Won't she notice I have makeup on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  半数的男人都有化妆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please. Half the guys out there have makeup on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,半数的人  你就试试看嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Half the people-I mean-Just try it and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  我死也不化妆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I am not putting on makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  帮我贴几张传单好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Ross, could you put up some of these flyers for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼  魔鬼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! Demon! Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样抽屉就会闻起来香香的  旧裤袜也没浪费\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now our drawers will smell nice, and we didn't waste these pantyhose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  扔旧内衣会遭天打雷劈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God forbid we throw out old underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去乔伊那边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I'm gonna go over to Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还要整理包装纸抽屉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're supposed to organize the wrapping paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但我今天已经够女性化了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but I've really gotten in touch with my feminine side enough today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是再缝两个香袋   我们就要变成女同志了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know. In fact I think we're two sachets away from becoming a lesbian couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的确很女孩子气  你说得对  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This has been kind of a girlie day. You're right. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  我只是想去男人的家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nah, Nah, it’s okay. I feel like I need to be in guy place....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做男人做的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}..You know, do kind of like a man thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  去乔伊家吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Go over to Joey's. Go over to Joey's and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.53,0:11:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去乔伊家喝啤酒槌墙壁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...drink some beer and hammer up some dry wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男人并非只会喝酒槌墙壁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know when guys hang out, they don't just drink beer and hammer up dry wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女生也不会只穿内衣打枕头仗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When girls hang out, we don't have pillow fights in our underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我们会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. We do. We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么说不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know why I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来  我们在织隔热手套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on in. We're knitting potholders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了  乔瑟芬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, thanks, Josephine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我想说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I was wondering if--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  男人都死哪去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Where are all the men?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Hi, Kim. Hi, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得我昨天说的事吗  其实没那回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, remember that thing I told you that happened yesterday? Well, it didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有取消台湾的布料订单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You didn't cancel the fabric order from Taiwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  有两件事不是那么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, two things didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说有人在复印室  跟罗夫罗兰亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember I told you someone made out with Ralph Lauren in the copy room?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果是假的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it turns out that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是假的  那就好玩了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not true? Oh, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我去查过   昨天午休时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I checked. Only one keycard was used to access the copy machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刷卡进复印室的  只有你一个  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...yesterday during lunch, and that keycard belonged to you, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  天哪  你以为我跟他亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. No, no, no. Oh, God, you think I made outwith him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  要是你以为跟罗夫上床  就能坐上我的位子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen to me, if you think sleeping with Ralph is gonna get you my job...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}..you are sadly mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想坐你的位子   真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. I don't want your job. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.41,0:13:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是天大的误会  我没跟他亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this is such a mistake. I didn't make outwith him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人跟他亲热   我昨天没用我的卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody made out with him. I did not use my keycard yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我连刷卡都不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't even know how to use my keycard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗夫  金\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Ralph. Hi, Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没跟他亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的情欲张力一触即发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You could cut the sexual tension in here with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后  我也只能去当厨师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After that, what could I do except become a chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我将来想自己开餐厅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And someday soon, I hope to open my own restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很善于倾听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, you're a really great listener.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我交往过的男人  多半讲个不停\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Most guys I go outwith, they just talk and talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.56,0:14:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到后来  真想叫他们闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After a while, it's like, "Shut your mouth." You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说太多了  来聊聊你吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've probably been talking too much. Why don't we talk about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说嘛  我想知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我是长岛人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I'm from Long Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来纽约念书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I came to the city for college.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个5岁的儿子  平常喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I, uh, have a 5-year-old son, and in my spare time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看谍报小说  再来聊聊你吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I like to read spy novels. But let's talk more about you. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果先把花茎底部  在平底锅上烤一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what's really neat. if you sear the stems of the flowers first in a frying pan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花就能开得更久  是不是很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...your arrangement will look fresh much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒的小秘诀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, that is such a great tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  请你出去一下  我有事找那位插花的女士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, can you excuse us? I need to talk to the girl with the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你待会过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but, Joey, come over later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我教你  用松果和花生酱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna teach you how to make a bird feeder...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做喂鸟器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...out of just a pine cone and some peanut butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢鸟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw. I love birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么搞的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你在插花\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You're arranging flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你放枯掉的花\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got dead flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你装扮成一朵花的宝宝照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've got a picture of a baby dressed like flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is not Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我还是乔伊   好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey, look, I am still Joey, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花  只不过是很好看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Flowers, they're just, you know, nice to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.89,0:15:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个名摄影师照的  宝宝也很有名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that happens to be a picture by a famous artist of a famous baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你正在变成女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're turning into a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这么说   好恶劣啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would you say that? That's just mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我惹你生气了  我说了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now I've upset you? What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:16:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你说了什么   是你的口气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not what you said. It's the way you said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在她觉得我跟他上床  好把她踢下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So now she thinks that I made out with him and that I did it to get her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不跟她说实话  我说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why didn't you just tell the truth? I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她觉得不会有人蠢到  把复印小弟当成罗夫罗兰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but she doesn’t think anyone would be stupid enough to confuse Kenny the copy guy with Ralph Lauren.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果肯尼才是公司的首脑呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hey, what if Kenny were the real brains behind the whole company?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好罗夫罗兰也只是个门面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know. What if Kenny hired that Ralph guy to be the pretty front man, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她想过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did she ever think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天跟肯尼约会了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were with Kenny today, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一下下了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just for a second. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, what am I gonna do? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只好跟罗夫罗兰上床了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only thing you can do. Sleep with Ralph Lauren.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不跟罗夫罗兰上床   我可以  但是我不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna sleep with Ralph Lauren. I mean, I could, but I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟肯尼上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. Sleep with Kenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样对我也没好处  好处可大了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That wouldn't help me. Oh, yes, it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚真的很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've had a really good time tonight. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很少第一次约会   就这么心有灵犀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I rarely connect with someone this much on the first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I've had a really good time too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃那块面包吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you gonna eat that bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是喜欢闻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I just like the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好搞笑啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要去沙发上坐坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you like to move over to the couch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把灯光调暗一点好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I'll just turn down the lights a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干脆关灯如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about all the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好酷的海报\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, cool poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是要说 "好抢眼的海报"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or should I say, "groovy poster"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才聊到哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.42,0:18:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的牙齿吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are those your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看得见是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can see them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  白得很吓人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. They're insanely white.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我特地为你漂白的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有毛病吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有毛病  你还装黑光灯咧   都1999年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter with me? You've got a black light. It's 1999.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了   金\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good. Kim, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我一直想问你  你看过新的罗夫罗兰床单吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Rachel. Oh. I wanted to ask you, have you seen the new Ralph Lauren sheets?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.09,0:18:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想什么  你当然看过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What am I thinking? Of course you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:18:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉之前对你说谎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry that I lied to you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜得没错  罗夫和我交往过  但已经结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were right. Ralph and I were an item, but we're not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他甩了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, he dumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说  "瑞秋  我不能这样"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He said, "Rachel, I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"虽然你真的很美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Even though you're a very, very...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很美"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...very beautiful woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我不能这样  我有家室  对不起"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I can't do this. I'm married and I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后不知为何他又说  "你永远也不会升职\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I don't know why, but he said, "And you will never get promoted...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其不可能高过金   她是罗夫罗兰体系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...especially not above Kim, who is an integral cog...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可或缺的重要人物"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in the Ralph Lauren machine."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You expect me to believe--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗夫  金\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Ralph. Hi, Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他看你的眼神好冷酷  彷佛对你恨之入骨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He just gave you the coldest look I've ever seen. It's like he hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以是真的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then it is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是真的  我好难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course it's true. And it hurts so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  亲爱的  过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, honey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.09,0:20:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've all been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和罗夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You and Ralph?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复印小弟肯尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kenny the copy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要说  怎么了  你心情不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I need to talk to you. What's the matter? You upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉   我们得把这些女生的东西扔掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, but we gotta get rid of all this girlie stuff in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得当个男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, uh-I gotta be a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  客厅必须维持男人的风格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? The living room has to remain a guy place, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.42,0:20:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's just the way it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此  我就拿回我房里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If that's what you want, I'll just put it all in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好   谢谢你的谅解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, thanks for being so understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想搞得很难看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't want to make a big deal out of this. you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.89,0:21:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝的照片可以挂在我房里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you could, uh, put the picture of the famous baby in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花洒的画也可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, maybe the watering can there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有这对小盒子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And a couple of these little tiny boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   要不要都放到你房里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, do you want me to put it all in your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
